[thin] This small 3.000 mm ranking reads the ordinary front skin adjoining the localized aperture-rim backing. The analytic offset supplies Y0 to Y3 stock here; the thicker working rim backing remains confined to the aperture's R6 return.
alternatives: Thickening the full front field to 4 mm adds material outside the working rim and narrows the hollow interior. Extending the 9 mm rim backing across the whole front enlarges unused stock. Neither change adds a selected reference surface or improves this already 3 mm normal section.
